<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/managed-print.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Products &amp; Services</span>
    <h1>Managed Print</h1>
    <p>Kyocera's award-winning multifunctional printers allow you to easily print, copy, email, scan and fax documents across your network, delivering superior performance and best-in-class reliability for businesses.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    

    <div class="split-row">
      <div class="split-row__copy">
        <h2>Unique Tiered Colour Printing</h2>
        <p>Kyocera's unique Tiered Colour System has revolutionised the way businesses pay for colour printing, allowing you to only pay for the colour you use. Kyocera puts you in control — allowing you to print impactful documents with a splash of colour, or vibrant full colour pages, all within your budget.</p>
        <ul class="tier-bars" aria-hidden="true">
          <li>Splash of colour <span class="bar"><span></span></span></li>
          <li>Impactful documents <span class="bar"><span></span></span></li>
          <li>Vibrant full colour <span class="bar"><span></span></span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="split-row__media" data-reveal>
        <img src="/images/taskalfa.webp" alt="Kyocera TASKalfa multifunction printer" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-head" style="margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <h2>Longer Life and Lower Costs</h2>
        <p>Kyocera's award winning ECOSYS technology uses an imaging system built from silicon — not plastic — that dramatically lowers your total cost of ownership and required maintenance. Kyocera printers can effortlessly print up to 600,000 pages in their lifetime, with no compromise to image quality.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <h2>Environmentally Friendly</h2>
        <p>In traditional laser printers, the print drum is contained in the consumable cartridge that is replaced each time the toner runs out. By making them permanent components, Kyocera has greatly reduced the lifetime waste of its ECOSYS printers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

<div class="highlight-panel">
      <p class="highlight-panel__figure">30%</p>
      <p>By combining the advantages of Kyocera with our managed print service, you can reduce your total cost of ownership by up to 30% — just by using less.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-block">
      <span class="eyebrow">Kyocera</span>
      <ul class="capability-tags">
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> MFD's</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Desktop Printers</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>


